{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, actionUrl --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}}, 👋</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">You're in! 🎉</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Your creator profile just got approved on <strong>{{platformName}}</strong>. Brands are scouting talent right now — let's make sure they find <em>you</em>.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fdf2f8;border:2px solid #181313;border-radius:12px;">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#111827;">
    <strong>Your next move ✨</strong><br />
    Complete your profile, add your best work, and go live so briefs can start rolling in.
  </p>
</div>
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Go to my account →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team 💗</p>
